          "min_libbridgething_version": "0.17.0",
          "changelog": "First public version. Same app as the private 0.1.0 test build, plus the app icon.\n\n- Four screens: Tide now, Moon & tide, Flood risk, On the water.\n- NWS alert strip on every screen (red for warnings, amber otherwise), spoken warnings through the phone.\n- US coasts only. Data from NOAA CO-OPS, NOAA NDBC and the National Weather Service.\n\nNot tested: speech over the car speakers, the live NWS alert lookup, flood-level conversion at stations other than Charleston, SC."
